  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Large-format digital printing",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We often combine digital printing with plotter-cut graphics to get the best possible result in both looks and durability.",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Materials: we can print on paper, self-adhesive film, translucent (backlighting) film, perforated film, banner and textile materials.",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Processing: latex digital printing that reproduces any design and colour combination down to the smallest detail. We laminate the prints with a gloss or matt laminating film, which increases resistance above all outdoors. We guarantee the colour fastness of our prints for at least three years.",
   "anchor": "uvod"
