  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Quality and service life come first",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We run modern large-format printing on our own latex printer and finish it with protective lamination, which gives us rich colours and lasting resistance even outdoors.",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "How it’s made",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Modern technology",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We own a modern printer built for digital printing of large-format advertising and banners. We work with latex printing technology. It achieves full, rich colours that stay true for years, even with detailed artwork and demanding colour combinations.",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Maximum durability",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We laminate our prints, which ensures maximum colour durability, above all on prints outdoors that are exposed to constant sunlight. Lamination also protects the advertisement against mechanical damage, and you can choose between a gloss or matt laminating film.",
   "anchor": "uvod"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Indoors and outdoors",
   "anchor": "rezana-grafika"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Custom-made",
   "anchor": "rezana-grafika"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Plotter-cut graphics",
   "anchor": "rezana-grafika"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "By plotter-cut graphics we mean lettering cut out of self-adhesive film. Its advantage is a long service life. It suits every type of advertising and information lettering.",
   "anchor": "rezana-grafika"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Materials: coloured self-adhesive films suitable for application to a wide range of surfaces. The films we use stay colour-fast for up to seven years.",
   "anchor": "rezana-grafika"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Processing: the lettering is cut to the required shape on a plotter and then applied to the base surface – which can be almost any surface with sufficient adhesion. It cannot produce colour gradients or more complex motifs at the quality digital printing achieves. Where needed, we therefore combine the two techniques.",
   "anchor": "rezana-grafika"
  },
  {
