  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Decals",
   "anchor": "dalsi-druhy-polepu"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Advertising decals for vehicles, shop windows, glazing and floors – in printed as well as plotter-cut graphics.",
   "anchor": "dalsi-druhy-polepu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Vehicle and shop window decals: full and partial vehicle wraps as well as standalone lettering. We prepare the artwork together with you and take care of professional application. We produce shop window and glazing decals using printed or plotter-cut graphics – for advertising messages, information texts, opening hours, photographs and logos.",
   "anchor": "dalsi-druhy-polepu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Perforated and privacy window films: perforated film limits the view into the interior while the view out is preserved and little daylight is lost. Privacy window film blocks the view in from outside – most often we use sandblast-effect film, which lets light through but limits visibility through the glass. Motifs can be cut into the film, which comes in a range of shades.",
   "anchor": "dalsi-druhy-polepu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Floor decals and safety features: self-adhesive anti-slip films put floor space to effective use for advertising and suit business premises as well as public spaces. Safety features for the visually impaired help people with low vision move around safely.",
   "anchor": "dalsi-druhy-polepu"
  },
  {
